<title>POLAND: BORYSZEW NOV NET JUMPS TO PLN 1.5 MLN.</title>
<headline>BORYSZEW NOV NET JUMPS TO PLN 1.5 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results November</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.49 vs   0.81</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.49 vs   1.43</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.60 vs   1.75</p>
<p> Sales		   11.38 vs  13.81</p>
<p>JANUARY-NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     7.71 vs   6.77</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	12.93 vs  10.76</p>
<p> Operating profit    15.20 vs  12.66</p>
<p> Sales		   92.60 vs 100.06</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish chemical company is Boryszew SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
